{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_title", "source_sha256": "55f1473b51c44fc2bdd12d279d4870d930b492100fbb190b4d3cc77615ae6e8f", "ja": "福田のり子センター公演、60分一本勝負！", "zh": "福田法子的Center公演，60分钟定胜负！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a7cf35c378ab79ed4480c1d6bb1898e85365ca0c289302135827d4cb9b3578f6", "ja": "新人レスラー興行でのセンター公演に向け、\nMCの練習にも余念がないのり子達。ひとりに\nなったのり子は自信がないと不安な様子を\n見せるが、プロデューサーのアドバイスで\n元気を取り戻し、公演を成功させる。", "zh": "为了准备在新人摔角选手的表演活动上进行\nCenter公演，法子她们也勤加练习主持环节。\n但当只剩自己一人时，法子便显露出缺乏自信\n且不安的一面，而制作人给的建议使她再度\n恢复精神，顺利完成公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1864caed7e46573b0475cb55e0ad42fab1624631025f0cd1d67b83378d1a81d4", "ja": "（のり子の、プロレス会場での公演が終わった。\nリングを包む熱気は、まだまだ冷めやらない！）", "zh": "（法子在职业摔角会场进行的公演结束了。\n包围着擂台的热气久久不散！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "0719861e841e0470479e5e25f82be3f3633204e77a07a810b23d0ac033b9a4bb", "ja": "はぁっ、はぁっ……{$P$}！\n今のステージ、どうだった！？　楽しかった！？", "zh": "呼、呼……{$P$}！\n刚才的表演怎么样啊！？你看得开心吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "264bd62f05567379b63c01b1a91d22611fbce1ecfaeae86bdeab63d62bdb813d", "ja": "自分では、けっこうがんばったと思うんだけど……。\nあー、でもな～……うーん！", "zh": "我自己是觉得我已经很努力了……\n啊──可是……唔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1003_p", "source_sha256": "cfec082ffc80326fbe1881f2ae657132694e416023b4e97902dba7f5f26581f6", "ja": "お疲れさま！　うん、のり子自身が\n楽しかったと思ったなら、それが正解だと思うよ。", "zh": "辛苦了！嗯，\n既然法子你自己感到很开心，那就是正确答案了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "4bccce5cabc8dbf28620d70a0d7a1c53e40f3a6c0cd34f8c56b56d61f959e371", "ja": "う、うん……そっか！　そっか……。\nえへへ、やったねっ♪", "zh": "嗯、嗯……是这样啊！是这样啊……\n嘿嘿，太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "9c0042462a496e97e80bc57b7bd78c6fa294d51695864bf12e50726d8d45bcf8", "ja": "のり子さん、お疲れさまでした！\nお客さんたち、すっごく楽しそうでしたね！", "zh": "法子，辛苦了！\n观众们看起来都很开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "edd55116c75929c8fc7f128ac4f48d35d3aa3a3fff11999c7e0a778a80440a09", "ja": "選手の人たちも、みんなでコールしてくれてたね。\nのり子さんのファンになっちゃったのかもよ？", "zh": "选手们也都有一起帮忙喊Call呢。\n搞不好他们已经是法子姊的粉丝了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "699defbf5aabcc1bcc4dad6383fbeb79269348710af61bd3fe3e81a542f2a2bb", "ja": "紗代子、桃子！　ふたりとも、ありがとうっ！\n一緒にリングに立ってくれて。", "zh": "纱代子、桃子！谢谢你们！\n太感谢你们跟我一起站上擂台了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "48f8d1b375bdad01c41ebbb297dbc3538f1802269ab3d0362b731953934b1559", "ja": "ううん！　すっごく熱くて、楽しかった……。\n今日のステージに一緒に立てて、よかった！", "zh": "不用谢啦！我真的觉得很热血又开心……\n今天有和你们一起站上舞台，真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "881094e80d88bb77911484ace471dd3786c57be8a8c7a1203b0ff13f455a2c74", "ja": "のり子、センター、カッコよかったよ！\n堂々としてたよね。", "zh": "法子，你当Center很帅喔！\n你的态度很大方呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "a430deeb9615e5218caf86126de04bfe5c64eda5f9954bc5ad84edf9f5c17f42", "ja": "のり子ちゃん、本当にお疲れさまっ！\nタオル持ってきたから、汗拭いてね♪", "zh": "小法，真的辛苦你了！\n我拿了毛巾过来，拿去擦汗吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "1541caf56233ea2457a5bdbeb69030733acb9d867154e5810bf1aa977e8a70e9", "ja": "ほらほら、みんなも風邪ひくといけないから。\n{$P$}さんも、はいっ！", "zh": "来来，大家也拿去擦，不然要是感冒就不好了。\n{$P$}先生也请用！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f63649c4c4f51640054e5806e76b5b16e8ba3113aaedfa29a0cb4a2d203322bc", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう。\nみんなも、本当にお疲れさま！", "zh": "嗯，谢谢你。\n各位，真的辛苦你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "12bea95ef003961b1a13e8827765f620ef1e98619b6162e55b0aa74d5aa75b62", "ja": "真、美奈子、ありがとう！\nアタシがちゃんとやれたのは、みんなのおかげだよ～！", "zh": "真、美奈子，谢谢你们！\n我之所以能好好表现，都是多亏有你们～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "56b411c886cc7e4948026f4d6804332d7099d8973462fd4f16fd31806fdfbbb8", "ja": "それは違うよ。のり子が、がんばったからだよ。\nダンスのレッスンも、一生懸命だったじゃないか。", "zh": "不对喔，是多亏法子你自己的努力啊。\n你之前不是拚了命地练习跳舞吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "c0167dbeb836b1cbff160ea90f9741d88f61b57c0651e4387f13b141289c3f50", "ja": "そうですよ！　歌やダンスだけじゃなく、\nMCだって、あんなに練習して。", "zh": "就是说啊！而且不只是唱歌跳舞，\n你连主持也那么努力练习了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "85123f0ae5cb6225e6bd3fd349ea642a94a53791068727ed0bc5849ecfa72926", "ja": "うん。今日のステージでののり子さんを見てたら、\nのり子さんが言ってた意味、わかったかも。", "zh": "嗯，今天看到法子姊在舞台上表演，\n桃子好像能理解法子姊之前说的话是什么意思了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "3f52d3f78d95960d0c9bd6abd2961ab80679cde9502aa3175ce07e9c44d86720", "ja": "プロレスは、乱暴なだけじゃないって……。\n桃子も、ちょっと好きになったかな。", "zh": "你说过，职业摔角不只是粗暴而已……\n桃子好像也稍微喜欢上职业摔角了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "20dd698f17048239c4ee01e5431c0b3670576e24ca9da252da1d4e6e59302152", "ja": "う、うわ～っ！？　桃子、それ本当っ！？\nすっごくうれしいよ！", "zh": "哇，哇～！？桃子，你是说真的吗！？\n我好高兴喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "9bfd099effb6dd8faec86ebee7c43544c5fe31fc5d535da01eb6f5beb5903fc5", "ja": "アタシ、いつもプロレスに元気もらってるから。\nちょっとくらい、お返しできたかな……？", "zh": "摔角总是带给我许多活力，\n这样我也算是多少有做出回报了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1020_p", "source_sha256": "0f7922d68226ccc7d40421567bb764f409195ea3b8e806a8b434160274d1ec27", "ja": "それなら、十分できてたと思うよ。\nのり子にセンターを任せてよかった。", "zh": "我想你已经充分回报了喔。\n有让法子来当Center真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "26eccdc75c13128fd68423f935fd7049d2edb5fc09797b6793f7791955142129", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nう、うぅ……。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n呜、呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "159dc627d62a752b6c0ed11fd5c92cbfa1409f812b3c6d3f2da4824699ec99f6", "ja": "うわ～んっ！！！", "zh": "呜哇～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1024_027say", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "eadc973214bf5757e746b0c54ae22d88122941bbb044f0873ce1382e8538782d", "ja": "わっ、のり子ちゃん！？\nほら、ティッシュ、ティッシュ！", "zh": "哇，小法！？\n来，卫生纸，卫生纸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1026_006mak", "source_sha256": "18051bcd361b53e48511756211b5e5d5221d0d2f9b56b0f953beb10fa2505057", "ja": "ああっ！？\n{$P$}が、のり子泣かせた！", "zh": "啊啊！？\n{$P$}把法子弄哭了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1027_p", "source_sha256": "90eac77917e7ce784b7b15a6e057ab108842dd8c7bc30100c154adf0375b17a0", "ja": "ええっ！？\nい、いや……今のは、桃子がきっかけじゃないか？", "zh": "咦咦！？\n不、不是……是桃子先开始的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "d7619d99b38908535fc078a205376210987369b7294bd9c7530a44af3b477552", "ja": "お、お兄ちゃんでしょ！？　桃子のせいにしないで！\nえっと……大丈夫？　のり子さん……。", "zh": "是、是大哥哥不好吧！？不要怪到桃子身上！\n呃……法子姊，你还好吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1029_p", "source_sha256": "a6b4ab1f195d7ca9f5fd4a2d1dcad9aa3c4483a3610758954f2668ee44eec753", "ja": "そ、そうだのり子、焼肉だ！\n焼肉に行こう！　この前、行けなかったし！", "zh": "对，对了法子，烧肉！\n我们去吃烧肉吧！我们上次没有去成嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1030_043nor", "source_sha256": "a30834ac6dadbabc6df4f2ab96bbde8f7f62c7f1f7e7997213a75c3daf4f5759", "ja": "えっ……焼肉？　ホントに？\nぐすっ……。", "zh": "咦……烧肉？真的吗？\n呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1031_043nor", "source_sha256": "f8d3809a92efd3a06394a3080ebfef2414d4566c1c5b2ec09df920aab5248995", "ja": "好きなだけ食べても、いいの……？\nみんなも、一緒に……？", "zh": "可以随便我吃吗……？\n其他人也会一起来吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1032_p", "source_sha256": "611b080f4d0aacc63d139a247975fdbc0bdd1804911755c95a2f5f7c526bdf38", "ja": "あっ……ああ、好きなだけ食べていいぞ！\nみんな一緒だ！", "zh": "呃……可以啊，尽量吃吧！\n大家一起去吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1033_043nor", "source_sha256": "487a939ef711093c260609607e7061aff7ea364c27e4d5bab9c56e25dbacb081", "ja": "やった～～っ！！！\nみんな、打ち上げ焼肉だって！　行こう行こうっ♪", "zh": "太棒了～～！！！\n大家，听说庆功宴要去吃烧肉喔！走吧走吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1034_027say", "source_sha256": "3c493b6a6c3a07f52f4fe86ca7de3102298c07a6ce6f514e97ce3e7c97b51116", "ja": "いいんですか？　{$P$}！\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "真的可以去吗，{$P$}！\n谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "0f62a70315f1da674a29cedf5056a40732af8ac3e2a581192beb90bef2f3a221", "ja": "のり子さん、元気になったみたいだね。\nお兄ちゃんにしては上出来だよ♪", "zh": "法子姊好像恢复活力了呢。\n以大哥哥来说，还算做得不错嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_037_1036_006mak", "source_sha256": "42920048874559881252a73e03260804bd80cc50b476d11d5dcedbf2788b9a1b", "ja": "ごちそうさまですっ！", "zh": "谢谢招待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
